ct that the volumes in the first quarter were a little lower than what we expected, I think that's the reason why reduced our guidance on EPS for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/23/canadian-national-railway-company-cni-q1-2018-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2018 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2018-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"And regarding tariffs, if we look at what we know, which is what's in place today, which is duty on lumber, duty on aluminum, and duty on steel, at this point, there's actually no material effect on our result.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/24/canadian-national-railway-company-cni-q2-2018-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2018 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2018-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Seidl","x":"And yeah, I would echo my congratulations to J.J. J.J., your Canadian competitor outlined some potential exposure to the tariff situation and gave investors some color.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/24/canadian-national-railway-company-cni-q2-2018-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2018 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2018-07-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Cherilyn Radbourne","x":"Do you think maybe you can help us sort of think through the moving parts there in terms of the volume backdrop, you know, a more positive pricing environment?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/24/canadian-national-railway-company-cni-q2-2018-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2018 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2018-07-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"And it is -- therefore, it is this confidence in our business and confidence in our railroading acumen of the team that we are raising the 2018 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/24/canadian-national-railway-company-cni-q2-2018-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2018 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2018-07-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"The team is energized, and for that reason, we've increased our guidance, because we're optimistic about the future here ahead of us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/24/canadian-national-railway-company-cni-q2-2018-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2018 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2018-10-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"So that fall peak might be extended on the back of strong -- demand is strong and there's still potential tariff coming in at the end of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q3-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2018 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2018-10-23","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Scott Group","x":"Is it temporary, is it -- are there timing issues, because of tariffs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q3-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2018 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2018-10-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ghislain Houle","x":"I mean, we are reiterating our guidance, where our guidance on volume is 5%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q3-2018-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2019 Q1","e":"cni","d":"2019-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"As we do after every winter, we are now taking the opportunity to right-size our asset base, including the return of leased locomotive and putting railcars into storage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q1-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2019 Q1","e":"cni","d":"2019-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Cory","x":"With good weather, we're seeing the payoff of our track capacity projects and we're very, very active in right-sizing our asset base as we're looking to drive velocity, productivity through the short-term reduction of cars, locomotive and people.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q1-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2019 Q1","e":"cni","d":"2019-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"In the meantime, we are reaffirming our guidance for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q1-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2019 Q1","e":"cni","d":"2019-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ghislain Houle","x":"I think on the guidance side, I think we're comfortable, very comfortable and we looked, and as we do every quarter we look, we do a detailed bottom-up, top-down with the team and we did reaffirm the guidance today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q1-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2019 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2019-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Keith Reardon","x":"Thanks for your time today, looking forward to answering any of your questions during the Q&A. With that, let me pass it on to Ghislain, who will provide an update on the financials.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2019 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2019-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Keith Reardon","x":"We see good pricing power now; I don't know that that's going to increase at the ELDs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2019 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2019-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"We currently have about 200 qualified train crews on temporary layoff in our western region, waiting for the crude by rail volume opportunity to pick up higher, and we continue to progressively tighten down our overall management headcount.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2019 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2019-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Cairns","x":"We are rightsizing our fleet and resources accordingly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2019 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2019-07-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"In regards to 2019, we are reaffirming our guidance with continued focus on costs, focus on our PSR operation and focus on growth, but staying very mindful of market volatility.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2019 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2019-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Reilly","x":"All of these actions help to rightsize our fleet to the rail volumes we are experiencing and decrease our expenditures associated with them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/22/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q3-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2019 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2019-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ghislain Houle","x":"While we have witnessed weaker volumes driven by softness in the general economy, we swiftly rightsize our resources to changing demand while being conscious of the mid to long-term structural opportunities that are in front of us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/22/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q3-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2019 Q4","e":"cni","d":"2020-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"During last fall, we did what we said we would do to right-size the business to current weaker demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2019 Q4","e":"cni","d":"2020-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Reilly","x":"Jim Sokol, our VP of Mechanical continues to streamline our mechanical footprint across the network as the reliability of our locomotives increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q1","e":"cni","d":"2020-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"On that, I will pass it on to Rob who will talk to you about the operation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/27/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q1","e":"cni","d":"2020-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"So maybe I can start and then I'll pass it on to Keith.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/27/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q1","e":"cni","d":"2020-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Reilly","x":"Our priorities have been and continue to be to protect our employees, ensure the continuity of our railroad as an essential service and rightsize our resources to the decrease in demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/27/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q1","e":"cni","d":"2020-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Reilly","x":"We've also curtailed switching activities at multiple locations with reduced car volumes and discontinued work at a couple of more locomotive shops allowing us to further rightsize our transportation and mechanical workforces.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/27/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2020-07-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"On that note, I will pass it on to Rob.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2020-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"He will highlight progress we are continuing to make in cost takeout in bringing technology to the railroad industry and then the safety culture at CN.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2020-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert E. Reilly","x":"During the quarter, the team responded accordingly to the significant volume drops in rightsizing our resources, by idling four locomotive shops, as well as four additional switching yards.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2020-07-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ghislain Houle","x":"Let me finish by saying that as you know, we withdrew our guidance for the year on our last earnings call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q2-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2020-10-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"On that note, I will pass it on to Rob.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/20/cn-cni-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2020-10-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Keith Reardon","x":"I will now pass it on to Ghislain for the financial perspective.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/20/cn-cni-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2020-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Reilly","x":"As JJ mentioned, we saw a sequential recovery month-over-month during the third quarter and the team quickly adapted in rightsizing resources to the demand along the way.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/20/cn-cni-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2020-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Konark Gupta","x":"And do you have any permanent cost-out initiatives that are pending right now as in they will take place next year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/20/cn-cni-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2020-10-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ghislain Houle","x":"As you will recall, we withdrew our full-year guidance on our Q1 earnings call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/20/cn-cni-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q4","e":"cni","d":"2021-01-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"On that note, I will pass it on to Rob.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/27/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q4-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q4","e":"cni","d":"2021-01-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Keith Donald Reardon","x":"I will now pass it on to Ghislain for the financial perspective.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/27/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q4-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q4","e":"cni","d":"2021-01-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ghislain Houle","x":"During the quarter we witnessed significant volume improvements both sequentially and on a year-over-year basis and continue to rightsize our resources for the recovery, while remaining disciplined and focused on tightly controlling our costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/27/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q4-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"CNI 2020 Q4","e":"cni","d":"2021-01-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Cairns","x":"And this is a combination of deploying the new cars, rightsizing our unit trains to match horsepower, so that we don't leave any empty spots available that we could have moved.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/27/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q4-2020-earnings/"},{"c":"CNI 2021 Q1","e":"cni","d":"2021-04-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"So maybe I'll pass it on to Rob.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"CNI 2021 Q1","e":"cni","d":"2021-04-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Cherilyn Radbourne","x":"I wanted to ask, in relation to the increasing guidance for the year, and particularly the increase in your volume outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/canadian-national-railway-co-cni-q1-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"CNI 2021 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2021-07-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"I will now pass it on to Rob who will review our operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/21/canadian-national-railway-company-cni-q2-2021-earn/"},{"c":"CNI 2021 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2021-07-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Keith Reardon","x":"I will now pass it on to Ghislain for the financial perspective.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/21/canadian-national-railway-company-cni-q2-2021-earn/"},{"c":"CNI 2021 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2021-07-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jean-Jacques Ruest","x":"You will notice on our table, we reaffirmed our guidance that we're using an approximately $0.80 versus the $0.75 that we had originally in our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/21/canadian-national-railway-company-cni-q2-2021-earn/"},{"c":"CNI 2021 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2021-07-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ghislain Houle","x":"So we are very comfortable with reaffirming our guidance, David.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/21/canadian-national-railway-company-cni-q2-2021-earn/"},{"c":"CNI 2021 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2021-10-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James Cairns","x":"We're able to secure these price increases, because the customers realize they need the capacity that we have.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/20/canadian-national-railway-company-cni-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"CNI 2021 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2021-10-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christian Wetherbee","x":"But when you think about that, coupled with what you've already announced, headcount reductions of CAD100 million of cost savings that you're capturing here in 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/20/canadian-national-railway-company-cni-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"CNI 2021 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2021-10-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Seidl","x":"I wanted to talk a little bit about the headcount reductions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/20/canadian-national-railway-company-cni-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"CNI 2021 Q4","e":"cni","d":"2022-01-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rob Reilly","x":"With that, I'll pass it on to James and Keith to provide some insights on the efforts of our marketing team.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/26/canadian-national-railway-cni-q4-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNI 2021 Q4","e":"cni","d":"2022-01-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Keith Reardon","x":"I'll now pass it on to Ghislain for the financial perspective.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/26/canadian-national-railway-cni-q4-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNI 2021 Q4","e":"cni","d":"2022-01-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"JJ Ruest","x":"So, we will benefit from this headcount reduction throughout 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/26/canadian-national-railway-cni-q4-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNI 2021 Q4","e":"cni","d":"2022-01-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Reilly","x":"The sequential headcount reduction of 1,150 exceeded the target we set in September and was completed in Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/26/canadian-national-railway-cni-q4-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNI 2022 Q1","e":"cni","d":"2022-04-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Doug MacDonald","x":"With that, I'll pass it on to Ghislain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/26/canadian-national-railway-cni-q1-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNI 2022 Q1","e":"cni","d":"2022-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ghislain Houle","x":"We continues to benefit from the nonoperating headcount reduction that took place last fall as average headcount was down 7% in Q1 versus last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/26/canadian-national-railway-cni-q1-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNI 2022 Q1","e":"cni","d":"2022-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jeff Kauffman","x":"But I want to kind of shift beyond the downsizing in the cutting and the restructuring part to the growth part.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/26/canadian-national-railway-cni-q1-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNI 2022 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2022-07-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Doug MacDonald","x":"Before I pass it on to Ghislain, let me take the opportunity to highlight an example on how we plan to densify the eastern part of our network.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/26/canadian-national-railway-cni-q2-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNI 2022 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2022-07-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Doug MacDonald","x":"With that, I will pass it on to Ghislain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/26/canadian-national-railway-cni-q2-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNI 2022 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2022-07-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ghislain Houle","x":"So when you do all of that math, we come in with, again, reaffirming our guidance of 15% to 20%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/26/canadian-national-railway-cni-q2-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNI 2022 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2022-07-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ghislain Houle","x":"So when you put all of these in, again, we feel comfortable with reaffirming our guidance of 15% to 20% and with an OR that starts with a five.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/26/canadian-national-railway-cni-q2-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CNI 2025 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2025-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tracy Robinson","x":"Yes, we can rightly point to the challenges of a markedly worse macro and the impact of unanticipated shocks from tariffs and labor, which have impacted CN more than other rails.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/canadian-national-cni-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2025 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2025-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tracy Robinson","x":"As we look to 2026, we see another year of limited volume growth with a weak outlook for North American industrial production and housing starts and some mixed headwinds given the continued impact of tariffs on forest products in particular.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/canadian-national-cni-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2025 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2025-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Pat Whitehead","x":"With that, I'll pass it on to Janet.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/canadian-national-cni-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2025 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2025-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tracy Robinson","x":"Our actions, an increase focused on commercial intensity, operational agility, streamlining costs, and realigning capital to reflect current realities, have begun to deliver.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/canadian-national-cni-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2025 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2025-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ghislain Houle","x":"On the plus side, we're very pleased with our solid cost takeout, right-sizing our resources to align with volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/canadian-national-cni-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2025 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2025-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ghislain Houle","x":"We are therefore reaffirming our guidance of mid to high single-digit EPS growth in 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/canadian-national-cni-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2026 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2026-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Janet Drysdale","x":"Our metals volumes were up 11% in the second quarter despite the significant tariffs on steel and aluminum as we work with our customers to create new supply chain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/24/cni-cni-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2026 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2026-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Janet Drysdale","x":"In overseas intermodal, volumes were up sequentially, but lower year-over-year, reflecting tough comps due to last year's pull forward of volumes on tariff uncertainty.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/24/cni-cni-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2026 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2026-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jonathan Chappell","x":"You also highlighted $100 million of cost savings that you've identified this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/24/cni-cni-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2026 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2026-07-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tracy Robinson","x":"With this momentum, we are raising our guidance and now expect earnings for the year of mid- to high single digits on the back of low single-digit volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/24/cni-cni-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2026 Q2","e":"cni","d":"2026-07-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ghislain Houle","x":"As a result, we are raising our full year outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/24/cni-cni-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2026 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2026-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Janet Drysdale","x":"We're going to tackle that challenge head-on, in the same way that we've overcome the CAD 350 million of tariff headwinds from last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/cn-railway-cni-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2026 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2026-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tracy Robinson","x":"It was at a time when it was a pretty volatile environment, especially on the Canadian side with the impact of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/cn-railway-cni-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2026 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2026-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Pat Whitehead","x":"My job is to make sure that we're right-sizing resources to volume.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/cn-railway-cni-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2026 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2026-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Pat Whitehead","x":"Look, it's my job and this operations team job to wring out cost and waste, and we're going to continue to focus on productivity and right-size all of our resources to the volume that presents itself.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/cn-railway-cni-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2026 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2026-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tracy Robinson","x":"Looking at the balance of the year, we are reaffirming our guidance for mid-to-high single-digit EPS growth based on a low single-digit RTM growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/cn-railway-cni-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CNI 2026 Q3","e":"cni","d":"2026-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ghislain Houle","x":"Supported by our third quarter performance, we are reaffirming our guidance for mid-to-high single-digit growth in adjusted diluted EPS based on the low single-digit RTM growth, and we're currently tracking more towards the upper end of that range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/cn-railway-cni-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[32,1,10228,0,0,0,8543,1245],[33,1,11835,0,0,0,6858,4364],[34,1,12043,0,0,0,9281,2108],[35,1,11947,0,0,0,9027,2168],[37,1,10675,0,0,0,8341,1676],[38,1,10178,0,0,0,7718,1620],[39,1,11040,0,0,0,8913,1445],[40,1,12053,0,0,0,9274,2027],[41,1,10769,0,0,0,9569,486],[42,1,12394,0,0,0,11180,420],[43,1,10575,0,0,0,8635,1205],[44,1,10443,0,0,0,8468,1227],[45,1,9626,0,0,0,8663,444],[46,1,10812,0,0,0,9303,820],[47,1,10241,0,0,0,8728,839],[48,1,11255,0,0,0,9004,1598],[49,1,9965,0,0,0,7047,2270],[50,1,10460,0,0,0,7748,2088],[63,1,10858,0,0,0,10743,0],[66,1,9479,0,0,0,7444,1529],[67,1,9458,0,0,0,7476,1548]],"cinema":[[32,1,10228,0,0,0,8543,1245],[33,1,11835,0,0,0,6858,4364],[34,1,12043,0,0,0,9281,2108],[35,1,11947,0,0,0,9027,2168],[37,1,10675,0,0,0,8341,1676],[38,1,10178,0,0,0,7718,1620],[39,1,11040,0,0,0,8913,1445],[40,1,12053,0,0,0,9274,2027],[41,1,10769,0,0,0,9569,486],[42,1,12394,0,0,0,11180,420],[43,1,10575,0,0,0,8635,1205],[44,1,10443,0,0,0,8468,1227],[45,1,9626,0,0,0,8663,444],[46,1,10812,0,0,0,9303,820],[47,1,10241,0,0,0,8728,839],[48,1,11255,0,0,0,9004,1598],[49,1,9965,0,0,0,7047,2270],[50,1,10460,0,0,0,7748,2088],[63,1,10858,0,0,0,10743,0],[66,1,9479,0,0,0,7444,1529],[67,1,9458,0,0,0,7476,1548]],"imax":[[32,1,10228,0,0,0,8543,1245],[33,1,11835,0,0,0,6858,4364],[34,1,12043,0,0,0,